  "question": {
    "text": "$\\alpha, v$ and $u$ represent most probable velocity, average velocity and root mean square velocity respectively of a gas at a particular temperature. The correct order among the following is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "dsAax",
      "text": "\n$u>v>\\alpha$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "5xA61",
      "text": "\n$v>u>\\alpha$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tcRIj",
      "text": "\n$\\alpha>u>v$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "awae8",
      "text": "\n$u>\\alpha>v$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nu: v: \\alpha & =\\sqrt{\\frac{3 R T}{M}}: \\sqrt{\\frac{8 R T}{\\pi M}}: \\sqrt{\\frac{2 R T}{M}} \\\\\n& =\\sqrt{3}: \\sqrt{\\frac{8}{\\pi}}: \\sqrt{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n=1.224: 1.128: 1\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
